 Support the Research and Strategy Programme Manager in the production of the UPU's key macroeconomic and postal indicators, including those associated with the Integrated Index for Postal Development (2IPD) and the UN Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs)
- Collect, prepare and consolidate data to produce the annual 2IPD ranking as well as postal and macroeconomic indicators;
- Conduct measurement on the contributions of the postal sector (and the UPU)

